Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:06.00,Film,,0,0,0,,Hi! And welcome to SCRPT\NStudios!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.93,Film,,0,0,0,,You're about to see our\Nfull production line —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:11.55,Film,,0,0,0,,from one idea to every\Nproduct we create.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:15.03,Film,,0,0,0,,Let's start here, in the\Nwriting department. This
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:18.00,Film,,0,0,0,,is where we hatch ideas\Nfor new stories and turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.53,Film,,0,0,0,,them into full books.\NChapter by chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.98,Film,,0,0,0,,This is the art\Ndepartment, where every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.75,Film,,0,0,0,,book gets its face —\Ncovers, artwork and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:29.02,Film,,0,0,0,,character bible, so every\Nperson in your story looks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.16,Film,,0,0,0,,the same on the page, on\Nthe cover, and on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:36.17,Film,,0,0,0,,Our audiobook studios —\Nwhere the books learn to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.34,Film,,0,0,0,,speak. Listen—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:42.90,Film,,0,0,0,,The mountain had taken\Nthirty-one bodies in Luc
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:48.93,Film,,0,0,0,,Reyer's lifetime. He had\Ncarried down every one of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:49.53,Film,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:52.58,Film,,0,0,0,,And this is the part I\Nlove — the film studios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:56.89,Film,,0,0,0,,The stories become films\Nhere, right on this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:01:00.02,Film,,0,0,0,,This is the editing wing —\Nevery scene is cut, scored
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.73,Film,,0,0,0,,and mixed in here. It's\Nalso where we make the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:05.21,Film,,0,0,0,,trailers, and all the\Nmarketing creatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.74,Film,,0,0,0,,And this is our\Ndistribution centre. From
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:10.94,Film,,0,0,0,,here we ship everything to\Nthe platforms — the books
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:14.14,Film,,0,0,0,,to Amazon and Apple Books,\Nthe audiobooks to Audible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.98,Film,,0,0,0,,and Spotify, and our films\Nto Amazon Prime and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.06,Film,,0,0,0,,YouTube — ready to meet\Nthe audience as a finished
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:20.55,Film,,0,0,0,,product.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.92,Film,,0,0,0,,Everything you've just\Nseen is an imagined world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:26.20,Film,,0,0,0,,— but it shows you\Nsomething real: what SCRPT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:29.55,Film,,0,0,0,,can do for you as a\Ncreative. The writers, the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:32.84,Film,,0,0,0,,artists, the studios, the\Ntrucks — that's our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:36.33,Film,,0,0,0,,software, doing every one\Nof those jobs for your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.33,0:01:38.89,Film,,0,0,0,,stories. Books,\Naudiobooks, films —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.95,Film,,0,0,0,,written, produced,\Npublished and promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:44.53,Film,,0,0,0,,And the whole studio is\Nyours the moment you sign
